("Which of the following is an ICT-based teaching support?",["Learning Management System","Chalkboard","Flannel board","Printed chart"],"LMS like Moodle is ICT-based."),
("Edgar Dale's Cone of Experience places at its base:",["Direct purposeful experiences","Verbal symbols","Visual symbols","Motion pictures"],"The base is the most concrete experience."),
("In Computer Adaptive Testing:",["The difficulty of the next question depends on the previous response","All candidates get identical questions in the same order","Only essay questions are used","Results are declared after manual checking"],"CAT adapts item difficulty to responses."),
